<figure class="order-id-diagram" aria-labelledby="order-id-caption">
  <svg
    class="order-id-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 900 560"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="order-id-title order-id-desc"
  >
    <title id="order-id-title">訂單編號的三個資料邊界</title>
    <desc id="order-id-desc"
      >MySQL 的整數訂單編號經過精確讀取，成為 API
      和前端的字串，回傳明細請求時保持原值。</desc
    >
    <rect
      class="order-id-diagram__card"
      x="20"
      y="20"
      width="860"
      height="140"
      rx="16"></rect>
    <text class="order-id-diagram__title" x="48" y="58"
      >1　MySQL 與資料存取層</text
    >
    <text class="order-id-diagram__number" x="48" y="100">9007199254740993</text
    >
    <text class="order-id-diagram__body" x="440" y="100"
      >BIGINT → 精確讀取 → 十進位字串</text
    >
    <text class="order-id-diagram__body" x="48" y="135"
      >若 driver 已轉成失真的 Number，後面轉字串也無法補救。</text
    >
    <path class="order-id-diagram__arrow" d="M450 166v26m-6-6 6 6 6-6"></path>
    <rect
      class="order-id-diagram__card"
      x="20"
      y="202"
      width="860"
      height="140"
      rx="16"></rect>
    <text class="order-id-diagram__title" x="48" y="240"
      >2　API 回應與前端狀態</text
    >
    <text class="order-id-diagram__number" x="48" y="282"
      >"9007199254740993"</text
    >
    <text class="order-id-diagram__body" x="440" y="282"
      >JSON string → 路由、快取與選取清單</text
    >
    <text class="order-id-diagram__body" x="48" y="317"
      >短 ID 與長 ID 都用字串，避免同一欄位混用型別。</text
    >
    <path class="order-id-diagram__arrow" d="M450 348v26m-6-6 6 6 6-6"></path>
    <rect
      class="order-id-diagram__card"
      x="20"
      y="384"
      width="860"
      height="150"
      rx="16"></rect>
    <text class="order-id-diagram__title" x="48" y="422"
      >3　明細請求與資料查詢</text
    >
    <text class="order-id-diagram__number" x="48" y="464"
      >"9007199254740993"</text
    >
    <text class="order-id-diagram__body" x="440" y="464"
      >驗證格式、範圍與權限 → 參數化查詢</text
    >
    <text class="order-id-diagram__body" x="48" y="503"
      >往返後逐字相同，相鄰兩個 ID 仍能區分。</text
    >
  </svg>
  <svg
    class="order-id-diagram__mobile"
    viewBox="0 0 288 650"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="order-id-mobile-title order-id-mobile-desc"
  >
    <title id="order-id-mobile-title">訂單編號保持原值</title>
    <desc id="order-id-mobile-desc"
      >桌面圖的窄版排列。從資料庫精確讀出編號，API與前端使用字串，再驗證及查詢。</desc
    >
    <rect
      class="order-id-diagram__card"
      x="4"
      y="8"
      width="280"
      height="186"
      rx="12"></rect>
    <text class="order-id-diagram__title" x="20" y="42">1　資料庫讀取</text>
    <text class="order-id-diagram__number" x="20" y="81">9007199254740993</text>
    <text class="order-id-diagram__body" x="20" y="116"
      >BIGINT 精確讀成字串</text
    >
    <text class="order-id-diagram__body" x="20" y="147"
      >driver 若先丟失精度，</text
    >
    <text class="order-id-diagram__body" x="20" y="170"
      >事後轉字串也無法補救。</text
    >
    <path class="order-id-diagram__arrow" d="M144 200v24m-6-6 6 6 6-6"></path>
    <rect
      class="order-id-diagram__card"
      x="4"
      y="232"
      width="280"
      height="178"
      rx="12"></rect>
    <text class="order-id-diagram__title" x="20" y="266">2　API 與前端</text>
    <text class="order-id-diagram__number" x="20" y="305"
      >"9007199254740993"</text
    >
    <text class="order-id-diagram__body" x="20" y="340">JSON、路由、快取鍵</text
    >
    <text class="order-id-diagram__body" x="20" y="371"
      >都保留字串，不轉 Number。</text
    >
    <path class="order-id-diagram__arrow" d="M144 416v24m-6-6 6 6 6-6"></path>
    <rect
      class="order-id-diagram__card"
      x="4"
      y="448"
      width="280"
      height="190"
      rx="12"></rect>
    <text class="order-id-diagram__title" x="20" y="482">3　送回明細請求</text>
    <text class="order-id-diagram__number" x="20" y="521"
      >"9007199254740993"</text
    >
    <text class="order-id-diagram__body" x="20" y="556"
      >驗證格式、範圍及權限，</text
    >
    <text class="order-id-diagram__body" x="20" y="579">再使用參數化查詢。</text
    >
    <text class="order-id-diagram__body" x="20" y="610"
      >比對往返前後的完整 ID。</text
    >
  </svg>
  <figcaption id="order-id-caption">
    每個邊界都要保留原值，僅在最後一層轉字串仍可能太晚。
  </figcaption>
</figure>
